# Phone Server Configuration (phone-specific overrides only)
# Shared settings (PROXY_URL, PROXY_API_KEY, PHONE_API_SECRET) come from
# ../config.env automatically; set them here only to override that file.
#
# Everything else (AudioSocket port, VAD/TTS tuning, routes, languages,
# greetings, timeouts) is NOT configured via env — the proxy pushes it from
# its database over the management WebSocket at startup and on every change.
